  construct:version('concept.laparoscopy.position-gas-integration.v2','Separate gas direction from demonstrated acidemia','Interpret a controlled positional filling response and distinguish an acidifying gas change from an acidemic state using laboratory intervals.','The prior gas objective wrongly asserted acidemia from relative changes. This version instead scores recognition that a fall toward the reference interval is not demonstrated acidemia; retain the original histories and record the corrected construct explicitly.'),
